<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 9.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 9.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  July 9		 July 8</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.645		  3.731</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  12.240		 12.939</p>
<p>Cash balance		  16.885		 16.670</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,273.216	     5,268.692</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $7 million were issued and $117 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
